d 'MEXPLOT': module to draw mean and median excess plots 
d
d  mexplot plots for varname  mean of (varname - u | varname > u)
d and optionally median of (varname - u | varname > u)	against a
d varying threshold u. The first plot is variously known as a mean
d excess plot or a mean residual life plot.  A linear pattern in
d (the tail of) a distribution is expected if and only if the data
d resemble a generalised Pareto distribution. The command is an
d updated version of that discussed at the 6th London Stata meeting
d in 2000. 
d
d KW: distributions
d KW: graphics
d KW: extremes
d
d Requires: Stata version 8.2
d
d Distribution-Date: 20261025
d
d Author: Nicholas J. Cox, Durham University
d Support: email N.J.Cox@@durham.ac.uk
d
f mexplot.ado
f mexplot.sthlp
